   "value": "<p><em>Pachinko Fever — Cursed Technique Reversal</em></p><p>Your mastery over the Reverse Cursed Technique has granted you your technique’s reversal. Whenever you expand your domain, instead of rolling for a jackpot, you can force all creatures within your domain to roll for a Jackpot following the usual rules of your domain. On a Jackpot, a creature is rewarded with 10 cursed energy. On a failure, the creature loses all their current cursed energy and cannot regain cursed energy for 1 minute.</p>",
